@ =============================================================================
@ ff16x.inc - FatFs R0.16 w/patch 2, exFAT configuration: structure offsets and constants (DESIGN.md 7A, IMP-32)
@
@ Configuration (ffconf.h): FF_FS_EXFAT 1, FF_USE_LFN 1 (static working buffer, FF_MAX_LFN 255), FF_LFN_UNICODE 0,
@ FF_CODE_PAGE 437, FF_USE_MKFS 1, FF_LBA64 0, FF_FS_TINY 0, FF_FS_RPATH 0, FF_VOLUMES 1, FF_MIN_SS = FF_MAX_SS = 512,
@ the rest as DESIGN.md 7A.  The bootloader assembles the same sources with FF_FS_READONLY 1 and FF_USE_MKFS 0.
@ Offsets: offsetof / sizeof measured with arm-none-eabi-gcc (Cortex-M3) on ff.h R0.16 with this configuration.
@ Constants: every numeric #define of ff.c and ff.h evaluated for this configuration (gcc -dM).
@ =============================================================================

